<title>POLAND: EFEKT FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 60,800.</title>
<headline>EFEKT FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 60,800.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.06 vs   0.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.11 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.64 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Sales		    1.88 vs   0.91</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.16 vs   0.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.28 vs   0.46</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.19 vs   0.19</p>
<p> Sales		    4.48 vs   1.91</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler and retailer is</p>
<p>Korporacja Gospodarcza Efekt SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
